/*
  VehiclePhotoGallery.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0306 · VehiclePhotoGallery (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "VehiclePhotoGallery").
  Every key the native surface resolves lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English
  value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt
  owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/VehiclePhotoGallery.tsx) — the empty-state copy, the
  named/unnamed gallery aria-label, and the per-thumbnail open label. The second group is
  the native chrome the Apple leaf contract adds (the loading/error a11y, the retry, the
  freshness chip + banner, and the immersive-viewer counter / navigation / alt fallback),
  so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

/* --- Keys from the web source (parity) --- */
"vehicles.photos.empty" = "No photos uploaded yet.";
